      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASKERN VIOLET (6) was a (19.50) winner last time out at Goulburn from Box 4. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from three starts. Well placed and will be tough to beat. PAW GUSTO (4) has a terrific record this track and trip with five wins and one placing from six starts. Below best last time at Traralgon (24.28) in a Mix 3/4, finishing a 7 length fifth. Looks well placed here and among the chances. MAXIMUM JASMINE (2) was well off top last time, finishing 6th (20.29) in a Free For All at Traralgon. Form here at this distance is strong including two wins. Can measure up this time. DON'T CONFESS (1) scored an unexpected win last time. Cannot be ruled out.",
